{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-glob#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-glob","commit":"5c0ff214c936b96d1c33cd7f81dd13c11c85bbcc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-glob 是一个 DSH 工具插件，通过注册 glob_match 和 glob_to_regex 两个工具，为路径或字符串列表匹配 glob 模式，并可将 glob 模式转换为正则表达式。匹配支持单层通配符、跨目录通配符、单字符、选项和字符类，适合需要在 DSH 会话中筛选路径或查看模式对应正则表达式的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-85","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-glob#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-glob","commit":"5c0ff214c936b96d1c33cd7f81dd13c11c85bbcc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-glob adds two DSH tools: glob_match filters a path or string list with glob patterns, and glob_to_regex converts a pattern to a regular expression. Patterns support *, **, ?, alternatives, and character classes.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-85","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
